desc_en[0]="|2Potato mine explode on contact, but they take time to arm.$ $ |1Type: |3explosive$ |1Recharge: |320sec$ |1Range: |31 tile$ |1Damage: |3massive"
desc_en[1]="No one really knows what happens while Potato Mine is underground. Some people think that he plays poker with his spudd buds. Others think that he is just shy. What they don't know is that he is just preparing something big... A secret hideout! You see, one day, he wants to be a superhero! Like that would ever happen though."

desc_es[0]="|2Patatapum explota al contacto, pero le toma un tiempo armarse.$ $ |1Tipo: |3explosiva$ |1Recarga: |320seg$ |1Rango: |31 casilla$ |1Daño: |3masivo"
desc_es[1]="Nadie sabe realmente qué hace Patatapum mientras está bajo tierra. Algunos piensan que juega al póquer con sus colegas patata. Otros piensan que simplemente es tímido. Lo que no saben es que sólo está preparando algo grande... ¡Un escondite secreto! Verás, ¡quiere volverse un superhéroe! Como si eso fuese a pasar."